<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-GERMANY AND CROATIA LEVEL 1-1 IN FED CUP.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-GERMANY AND CROATIA LEVEL 1-1 IN FED CUP.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-07-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany and Croatia were level</p>
<p>1-1 after the opening singles on the first day of their Fed Cup</p>
<p>World Group play-off tie on Saturday:</p>
<p>Results:</p>
<p>Iva Majoli (Croatia) beat Meike Babel (Germany) 6-2 6-3</p>
<p>Anke Huber (Germany) beat Mirjana Lucic (Croatia) 6-2</p>
<p>6-2</p>
</text>
